{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"tool_EDfz2mD4VamzMsRNFOz9ivMu","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Result\n[\n  {\n    \"index\": 0,\n    \"src\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548199973-03cce0bbc87b?w=800&h=800&fit=crop\",\n    \"alt\": \"Veterinária com animal\",\n    \"complete\": true,\n    \"naturalWidth\": 800,\n    \"naturalHeight\": 800\n  }\n]\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('() => {\\n  const images = document.querySelectorAll(\\'img\\');\\n  const results = [];\\n  images.forEach((img, i) => {\\n    results.push({\\n      index: i,\\n      src: img.src,\\n      alt: img.alt,\\n      complete: img.complete,\\n      naturalWidth: img.naturalWidth,\\n      naturalHeight: img.naturalHeight\\n    });\\n  });\\n  return results;\\n}');\n```"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8567d3d0-4ba2-417f-9561-05f3f6a3cf4c","uuid":"7bba8bab-b6f7-49f2-ac27-b671fcf04f02","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"### Result\n[\n  {\n    \"index\": 0,\n    \"src\": \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548199973-03cce0bbc87b?w=800&h=800&fit=crop\",\n    \"alt\": \"Veterinária com animal\",\n    \"complete\": true,\n    \"naturalWidth\": 800,\n    \"naturalHeight\": 800\n  }\n]\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('() => {\\n  const images = document.querySelectorAll(\\'img\\');\\n  const results = [];\\n  images.forEach((img, i) => {\\n    results.push({\\n      index: i,\\n      src: img.src,\\n      alt: img.alt,\\n      complete: img.complete,\\n      naturalWidth: img.naturalWidth,\\n      naturalHeight: img.naturalHeight\\n    });\\n  });\\n  return results;\\n}');\n```"}]}
